TMIPA)[InBr$_4$], where TMIPA$^+$ = *N*,*N*,*N*-trimethyl-2-propanaminium, covering low-temperature phase, room-temperature phase, intermediate-temperature phase, and high-temperature phase, from 150 K to 550 K, 1 atm, sampled via active learning.

